      ],
      "source": "https://99wfmk.com/woodland-then-now/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Historic Woodland once hosted a blacksmith, drug store, shoe shop, post office, bank, general store, doctors, hardware, churches, and a grist mill.",
